arya, Rmnuja, 1017-1137, Thibaut, George Frederick William, 1848-1914 · 1890, 612 scanned pages. Published 1890; George Thibaut died 1914; public domain in India.</p><p>This book is not stored in this library: its pages are shown from the Internet Archive when they are opened, in this library's own viewer, and each chapter ends with this credit. The text of each page is the machine-read (OCR) text of the scan, lightly cleaned; the scan of every page is one button away. The item on the Internet Archive (opened only if you click it).</p>"},{"location":"rare-books/vedanta-sutras-thibaut/pages-1-25.html","title":"Pages 1–25","text":""},{"location":"rare-books/vedanta-sutras-thibaut/pages-101-125.html","title":"Pages 101–125","text":""},{"location":"rare-books/vedanta-sutras-thibaut/pages-126-150.html","title":"Pages 126–150","text":""},{"location":"rare-books/vedanta-sutras-thibaut/pages-151-175.html","title":"Pages 151–175","text":""},{"location":"rare-books/vedanta-sutras-thibaut/pages-176-200.html","title":"Pages 176–200","text":""},{"location":"rare-books/vedanta-sutras-thibaut/pages-201-225.html","title":"Pages 201–225","text":""},{"location":"rare-books/vedanta-sutras-thibaut/pages-226-250.html","title":"Pages 226–250","text":""},{"location":"rare-books/vedanta-sutras-thibaut/pages-251-275.html","title":"Pages 251–275","text":""},{"location":"rare-books/vedanta-sutras-thibaut/pages-26-50.html","title":"Pages 26–50","text":""},{"location":"rare-books/vedanta-sutras-thibaut/pages-276-300.html","title":"Pages 276–300","text":""},{"location":"rare-books/vedanta-sutras-thibaut/pages-301-325.html","title":"Pages 301–325","text":""},{"location":"rare-books/vedanta-sutras-thibaut/pages-326-350.html","title":"Pages 326–350","text":""},{"location":"rare-books/vedanta-sutras-thibaut/pages-351-375.html","title":"Pages 351–375","text":""},{"location":"rare-books/vedanta-sutras-thibaut/pages-376-400.html","title":"Pages 376–400","text":""},{"location":"rare-books/vedanta-sutras